<div class="page-head">
  <div>
    <h1>Duplicate accounts</h1>
    <p class="page-note">
      Accounts that share signup signals, grouped so a run of accounts created
      together can be read at once. This is a hint, not a verdict: the signals
      below are what the detector found, and only an operator can say whether
      they mean one person.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <h3 class="panel-title">What counts as a match</h3>
  <p class="muted">
    A cluster joins accounts that share a mailbox name, were created within
    fifteen minutes of each other, or carry the same handle shape. Any one of
    these groups unrelated people on its own - a shared mailbox name is the
    strongest hint because one person controls the addresses, a shared handle
    shape is the weakest because fandom produces it constantly. Nothing here
    bans, suspends or limits an account.
  </p>
</div>

<% if @clusters.any? %>
  <% @clusters.each do |cluster| %>
    <section class="admin-section">
      <h3 class="section-title">
        <%= cluster.size %> accounts
        <span class="pill <%= cluster.score >= 60 ? 'pill-warn' : 'pill' %>"><%= cluster.score %> signal weight</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="section-note">
        Strongest shared signal: <%= cluster.ordered_signals.first.label.downcase %>.
      </p>

      <div class="stack">
        <div class="signal-row">
          <% cluster.ordered_signals.each do |signal| %>
            <span class="signal">
              <span class="signal-label"><%= signal.label %></span>
              <strong><%= signal.detail %></strong>
            </span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>

      <table class="data-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th class="id">ID</th><th>Account</th><th>Email</th><th>Created</th><th></th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% cluster.accounts.each do |account| %>
            <tr>
              <td class="id"><%= account.id %></td>
              <td><strong>@<%= account.username %></strong></td>
              <td class="muted"><%= account.email %></td>
              <td class="muted"><%= account.created_at&.strftime("%d %b %Y %H:%M") %></td>
              <td>
                <a class="btn btn-mini" href="<%= admin_user_path(account.id) %>">Open</a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          <% end %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
  <% end %>
<% else %>
  <p class="muted">No accounts currently share a signup signal.</p>
<% end %>
